{
  "slug": "css_grid_align",
  "course": "css",
  "order": 181,
  "url": "/css/css_grid_align.asp",
  "title": "CSS Grid Container - Align Grid Content",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "CSS Grid Container - Align Grid Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "CSS Grid Container - Align Grid Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Inside the grid container you can define the alignment of the grid content\nwith the following properties:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "justify-content - Aligns the grid content when it does not use all available space on the main-axis (horizontally)",
        "align-content - Aligns the grid content when it does not use all available space on the cross-axis (vertically)",
        "place-content - Shorthand property for align-content and justify-content"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The CSS justify-content Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The justify-content property is used to\nalign the grid content when it does not use all available space on the main-axis (horizontally)."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "This property can have one of the following values:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": ["space-evenly", "space-around", "space-between", "center", "start", "end"]
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "variant": "note",
      "text": "The grid content's total width has to be less than the container's width for the\njustify-content property to have any effect."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: space-evenly;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_space-evenly"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: space-around;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_space-around"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_space-between"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: center;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_center"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: start;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_start"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n\n  justify-content: end;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_justify-content_end"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The CSS align-content Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The align-content property is used to\nalign the grid content when it does not use all available space on the cross-axis (vertically)."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "This property can have one of the following values:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": ["space-evenly", "space-around", "space-between", "center", "start", "end"]
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "variant": "note",
      "text": "The grid content's total height has to be less than the container's height for the\nalign-content property to have any effect."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "In the following examples we use a 300 pixels high container, to better demonstrate the align-content property."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: center;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_center"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: space-evenly;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_space-evenly"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: space-around;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_space-around"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: space-between;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_space-between"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: start;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_start"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  align-content: end;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_align-content_end"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The CSS place-content Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The place-content property is a shorthand\nproperty for the\nalign-content and the\njustify-content properties."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "If place-content has two values:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "place-content: start center; - the align-content\n  value is 'start' and\njustify-content value is 'center'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "If place-content has one value:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": ["place-content: end; - both align-content\n  and\njustify-content values are 'end'"]
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "variant": "note",
      "text": "The grid item's total height and width has to be less than the container's height\nand width for the\nplace-content property to have any effect."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  place-content: center;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_place-content_center"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": ".container {\n\n    display: grid;\n  height: 300px;\n\n  place-content: end space-between;\n}",
      "caption": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_grid_place-content2"
    }
  ]
}
